1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:50,690
Thousands of years ago,

25
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:55,250
the Ancestors of the Burning Fire country

26
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:58,370
sealed the Fire Spirit Beasts within the volcanoes.

27
00:01:58,800 --> 00:02:01,450
These Fire Spirit Beasts sought vengeance

28
00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:04,890
so they hunted lone cultivators to use as sacrifices

29
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:08,890
in order to feed a powerful Fire Spirit Beast King.

30
00:02:09,480 --> 00:02:12,290
Once the Fire Spirit Beast King is mature,

31
00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:15,930
they will reduce the Burning Fire country along with its neighbors

32
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:18,010
to ashes.

33
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:23,730
Now that the Fire Spirit Beast King has been devoured by the Heaven Defying Bead,

34
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:29,850
the enraged Fire Spirit Beasts will begin to attack the seals anyways.

35
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:53,610
I'm glad this seal exists.

36
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:55,170
Once Lin Tao brings me the map,

37
00:02:54,920 --> 00:02:56,650
I must leave the Burning Fire country.

38
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:24,930
That spiritual energy fluctuation was very powerful.

39
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:26,930
What do you think ?

40
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:27,330
Song Yunzhi
War God Shrine Ancestor
Late stage Nascent Soul

41
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:29,370
The others might not recognize this

42
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:31,130
but we all know that

43
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:33,130
Yang Sen
War God Shrine Ancestor
Middle stage Nascent Soul

44
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:33,410
this is the doing of the Fire Spirit Beasts.

45
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:36,770
It’s far more violent than usual this time.

46
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:40,970
But if we join forces to subdue these mere beasts,

47
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:42,130
it won't be a problem.

48
00:03:41,880 --> 00:03:43,410
That's nonsense.

49
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:45,530
The Fire Spirit Beasts are the fire element

50
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:48,130
so only water element spells can resist them.

51
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:51,330
How many water or cold type cultivators do we have ?

52
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:53,090
How could we...

53
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:56,850
Zhou Jin
War God Shrine Ancestor
Early stage Nascent Soul

54
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:55,930
Since the previous seals were effective,

55
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:57,050
then this time

56
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:59,130
we just have to reinforce the seals.

57
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,730
Rather than debating here,

58
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:01,930
we should act now.

59
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:03,490
I’ll take my leave first !

60
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:05,010
Enough,

61
00:04:04,920 --> 00:04:06,370
send the order.

62
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,530
All Ancestors and disciples

63
00:04:08,480 --> 00:04:11,730
are to reinforce the seals on the volcanoes in our territory.

64
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:13,930
Understood.

65
00:04:22,080 --> 00:04:24,850
I can finally feast to my heart’s content !

66
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:29,970
Come back here !

67
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:45,170
I have completed the water and fire elements.

68
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:47,530
Wood is only halfway done.

69
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:50,810
With metal and earth, that will be all 5 elements.

70
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:53,810
I wonder what power this bead will have

71
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:56,050
when all 5 are complete.

72
00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:05,250
Spare me Master !

73
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:07,330
Spare me Master ! Please...

74
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:11,610
If this happens again,

75
00:05:11,440 --> 00:05:12,610
you're dead.

76
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:14,250
Yes, yes, yes !

77
00:05:14,760 --> 00:05:17,050
How is this guy not dead yet ?

78
00:05:17,080 --> 00:05:20,930
Damn it ! And how did he find me ?

79
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,970
This is weird...

80
00:05:24,640 --> 00:05:27,610
Great Freedom Asura Art

81
00:05:24,640 --> 00:05:27,610
False Earth Escape Technique

82
00:05:25,280 --> 00:05:28,570
The Great Freedom Asura Art has six layers.

83
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:31,090
Kill people to refine their heart

84
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:33,530
and use this experience to transform your own heart.

85
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:37,050
Immerse yourself in the path of ruthlessness to make an Asura Soul.

86
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:40,250
This soul can replace a Nascent Soul.

87
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:44,730
Great Freedom Asura Art

88
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:44,730
False Earth Escape Technique

89
00:05:40,880 --> 00:05:42,450
To cultivate this art,

90
00:05:42,280 --> 00:05:44,530
kill one person per day.

91
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:45,970
One person per day ?

92
00:05:46,280 --> 00:05:48,170
If he practices this technique,

93
00:05:48,080 --> 00:05:50,970
won’t I have souls to devour every day ?

94
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:52,850
Congratulations Master,

95
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:54,250
congratulations.

96
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:55,730
With such a high-level technique,

97
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:58,450
your Nascent Soul breakthrough is within reach !

98
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:02,410
This jade slip came from Sun Youcai’s Senior Brother.

99
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:04,210
Since you already devoured him,

100
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:08,370
then this cultivation technique must be mediocre.

101
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:14,210
Great Freedom Asura Art

102
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:14,210
False Earth Escape Technique

103
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:16,370
This jade slip doesn't even contain a voice

104
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:18,730
and the technique’s name includes the word “false”.

105
00:06:18,760 --> 00:06:20,250
I'm sure it's worthless.

106
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:27,090
Great Freedom Asura Art

107
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:25,210
False Earth Escape Technique

108
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:24,650
Master, the Great Freedom Asura Art is far superior.

109
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:31,320
Senior Situ told me that the Earth Escape Technique is one of the elemental escapes.

110
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:33,890
They were famous in the ancient cultivation world.

111
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:36,010
Even if this one is an imitation,

112
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:39,650
it shouldn't be underestimated when compared to other spells.

113
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:43,250
Great Freedom Asura Art

114
00:06:40,760 --> 00:06:41,970
Master,

115
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:43,530
this technique is just for fleeing.

116
00:06:43,320 --> 00:06:45,810
It’s nowhere near as strong as that killing technique...

117
00:07:28,960 --> 00:07:32,250
Be it his talent or Spirit Root, Ma Liang's body

118
00:07:32,080 --> 00:07:34,130
is far superior to my previous body.

119
00:07:34,280 --> 00:07:37,930
Learning this False Earth Escape Technique felt effortless.

120
00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:46,730
East, west, north, south...

121
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:48,850
Ice crystals, fall !

122
00:08:03,400 --> 00:08:05,530
Formation, activate !

123
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:26,170
Senior Brother is amazing !

124
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:26,850
Indeed !

125
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:28,930
We couldn't fix the formation after half a month.

126
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:29,930
But with Senior Brother here,

127
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:31,410
those fire beasts are no big deal.

128
00:08:31,320 --> 00:08:33,530
We're safe with this formation.

129
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:34,930
Right !

130
00:08:35,400 --> 00:08:36,690
What’s happening ?!

131
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:39,330
How did the formation break ?

132
00:08:42,160 --> 00:08:43,250
Senior Brother !

133
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:45,450
Senior brother has fallen ! Run !

134
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:47,370
Send a message to the sect !

135
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:05,250
Big brother,

136
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:08,370
the volcanoes are erupting one after another.

137
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:10,250
We cultivators can still evade them

138
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:13,490
but the mortals have no means to resist.

139
00:09:14,400 --> 00:09:15,490
Wan’er,

140
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:17,540
now that the Burning Fire country

141
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:19,650
is filled with this violent fire spiritual energy.

142
00:09:19,880 --> 00:09:22,330
If we cultivators absorb too much of it,

143
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:24,170
we can lose our minds

144
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:25,930
and at worst, burn to death.

145
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:29,730
Do you think we cultivators have anywhere to hide ?

146
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:31,930
Unless…

147
00:09:36,800 --> 00:09:39,530
All disciples are to return to the sect at once.

148
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:52,330
I wonder why the Ancestors summoned us.

149
00:09:53,040 --> 00:09:56,250
Lan Ruo
Luo River Sect Ancestor
Middle stage Nascent Soul

150
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:56,210
You were called here

151
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:59,050
because of the Fire Spirit Beasts' rampage.

152
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:00,970
The country is now in chaos.

153
00:10:01,680 --> 00:10:05,050
The Luo River Sect, War God Shrine, Evil Devil Sect and Corpse Sect

154
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:07,170
have formed the Burning Fire Alliance.

155
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:08,370
And now,

156
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:11,530
the Burning Fire Alliance will migrate to the country of Xuanwu.

157
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,570
Burning Fire country

158
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,570
Evil Devil Sect

159
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,570
War God Shrine

160
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,570
Country of Chu

161
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,570
Country of Xuanwu

162
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,570
Cloud Sky Sect

163
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,570
Luo River Sect

164
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,570
Corpse Sect

165
00:10:11,680 --> 00:10:14,130
Xuanwu is crowded with sects.

166
00:10:13,880 --> 00:10:15,410
Will they be willing

167
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:16,810
to share their resources with us ?

168
00:10:16,640 --> 00:10:17,250
This…

169
00:10:17,560 --> 00:10:19,450
This will likely lead to war.

170
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:20,410
Indeed.

171
00:10:22,160 --> 00:10:25,890
Ancestor, if all the cultivators migrate

172
00:10:25,880 --> 00:10:29,010
then how will the mortals survive the Fire Spirit Beasts ?

173
00:10:28,800 --> 00:10:31,210
We’ve done our best to evacuate them.

174
00:10:31,320 --> 00:10:32,770
The Dao is merciless

175
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:34,930
so we must prepare for the worst.

176
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:37,450
There is no room for debate.

177
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:39,050
Follow the orders

178
00:10:38,880 --> 00:10:40,450
and prepare to migrate.

179
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:20,970
This flying sword is quite good.

180
00:11:21,560 --> 00:11:23,650
It's much faster than that iron scrap.

181
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:30,650
The time has come.

182
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:36,010
Hide inside.

183
00:11:56,680 --> 00:11:58,330
I can’t wait for Lin Tao anymore,

184
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:59,890
I need to reach the border.

185
00:11:59,680 --> 00:12:02,330
The Burning Fire country is no longer safe.

186
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:05,130
Such a powerful Divine Sense !

187
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:12,930
Damn it, they found me !

188
00:12:22,280 --> 00:12:24,770
These Fire Spirit Beasts resist Divine Sense attacks

189
00:12:24,560 --> 00:12:27,530
and even my flying sword barely hurts them.

190
00:12:28,680 --> 00:12:31,730
All things must have a weakness.

191
00:12:38,520 --> 00:12:39,650
As expected.

192
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:45,690
I'm going to die !

193
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:46,250
Master,

194
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:48,210
this little sword won’t last long.

195
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:49,210
Calm down.

196
00:12:54,200 --> 00:12:57,410
It seems that I’ll need the power of thousands of cultivators.

197
00:13:10,880 --> 00:13:13,090
Follow me to flank the Fire Spirit Beasts !

198
00:13:12,880 --> 00:13:13,930
Yes !

199
00:13:23,680 --> 00:13:24,970
Who are you ?

200
00:13:24,760 --> 00:13:26,330
State your name !

201
00:13:26,280 --> 00:13:29,530
I am a War God Shrine disciple, Ma Liang.

202
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:35,730
Qing Xuan, take him to the War God Shrine to confirm.

203
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:38,090
If he’s not a War God Shrine disciple,

204
00:13:37,880 --> 00:13:39,250
kill him.

205
00:13:39,040 --> 00:13:39,970
Understood.

206
00:13:46,280 --> 00:13:48,330
Qing Xuan of Luo River Sect

207
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:50,930
escorts Ma Liang of the War God Shrine.

208
00:13:50,680 --> 00:13:53,010
Fellow cultivators, please confirm his identity

209
00:13:52,920 --> 00:13:54,810
so I may report back.

210
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:56,610
Follow me.

211
00:13:57,280 --> 00:13:58,770
Where did this scoundrel come from ?

212
00:13:58,520 --> 00:14:01,330
How dare you impersonate a War God Shrine disciple !

213
00:14:14,080 --> 00:14:16,810
He destroyed my artifact so easily…

214
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:19,690
Thank you for your efforts, fellow cultivator Qing Xuan.

215
00:14:19,480 --> 00:14:21,770
Ma Liang is indeed our disciple.

216
00:14:25,280 --> 00:14:27,530
Thank you for escorting him.

217
00:14:35,280 --> 00:14:38,050
Does Master know Ancestor Feng Luan ?

218
00:14:39,080 --> 00:14:41,810
She sent me to bring you to her.

219
00:14:41,680 --> 00:14:42,730
Lead the way.

220
00:14:48,880 --> 00:14:52,370
Lin Tao was caught by Ancestor Feng Luan while copying the map.

221
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:54,130
The map is in her hands now

222
00:14:54,280 --> 00:14:56,050
and Lin Tao was punished.

223
00:15:01,160 --> 00:15:03,770
Wang Lin pays respects to Senior.

224
00:15:12,520 --> 00:15:15,530
Is Wang Lin your real name ?

225
00:15:24,400 --> 00:15:27,210
Not only did this brat steal a disciple's body

226
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:29,050
but he also lured the Fire Spirit Beasts here !

227
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:31,130
Do you know that in this battle,

228
00:15:30,920 --> 00:15:33,330
over a thousand of us died !

229
00:15:33,680 --> 00:15:36,130
I won’t allow you kill him !

230
00:15:43,880 --> 00:15:45,530
I can spare him.

231
00:15:45,560 --> 00:15:47,330
But since he’s not Ma Liang,

232
00:15:47,280 --> 00:15:49,130
he’s no longer our disciple.

233
00:15:49,120 --> 00:15:50,970
He cannot stay here !

234
00:15:51,880 --> 00:15:55,250
Wang Lin, do you want to be my disciple ?

235
00:15:55,280 --> 00:15:56,450
Disciple is willing.

236
00:15:57,920 --> 00:16:00,530
Since Junior Sister Feng Luan is willing to take him as disciple,

237
00:16:00,360 --> 00:16:02,130
I won't pursue this any further.

238
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:03,970
With the war coming up,

239
00:16:03,880 --> 00:16:05,930
this Foundation Establishment cultivator

240
00:16:05,880 --> 00:16:09,050
likely won't survive long on the battlefield.

241
00:16:11,920 --> 00:16:14,450
Sister Luan, why are you doing this ?

242
00:16:14,760 --> 00:16:17,330
You're the one that sent Hong'er to the Foreign Battlefield

243
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:19,530
but she encountered many dangers there.

244
00:16:19,480 --> 00:16:21,410
If not for this little friend,

245
00:16:21,160 --> 00:16:23,450
your daughter would have died there !

246
00:16:36,440 --> 00:16:38,570
War God Shrine

247
00:16:38,880 --> 00:16:42,330
This jade is a Nascent Soul-level artifact I crafted years ago.

248
00:16:42,160 --> 00:16:44,290
I've already wiped my Divine Sense from it.

249
00:16:44,080 --> 00:16:46,010
Refine it and use it.

250
00:16:45,880 --> 00:16:48,850
It should protect your life in this war.

251
00:16:49,720 --> 00:16:51,370
Thank you Senior.

252
00:16:52,600 --> 00:16:55,210
After we escape the Burning Fire country

253
00:16:55,280 --> 00:16:56,930
and reach the country of Xuanwu,

254
00:16:56,680 --> 00:16:58,250
the war will be fierce.

255
00:16:58,960 --> 00:17:01,730
We forgive your previous offences.

256
00:17:01,680 --> 00:17:03,530
But I will only help you only once

257
00:17:03,600 --> 00:17:06,570
to repay you for saving Zihong.

258
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:08,170
Dismissed.

259
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:16,930
When we reach the country of Xuanwu,

260
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:19,930
this person will be very useful.

261
00:17:31,050 --> 00:17:36,940
I've been walking this path for endless years

262
00:17:33,350 --> 00:17:36,940
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

263
00:17:37,330 --> 00:17:42,540
Is it the compass of fate

264
00:17:39,170 --> 00:17:42,540
that wrote this outcome for us ?

265
00:17:42,450 --> 00:17:48,460
The heavens want to erase your existence,

266
00:17:48,330 --> 00:17:54,180
that's the obsession guiding me.

267
00:17:54,210 --> 00:17:59,780
Is this the path to uncover

268
00:17:56,090 --> 00:17:59,780
truths from falsehoods ?

269
00:17:59,810 --> 00:18:05,380
In a world of murk and shadow,

270
00:18:01,710 --> 00:18:05,380
only the flame of truth can light the way.

271
00:18:05,170 --> 00:18:11,100
Look at them all,

272
00:18:08,050 --> 00:18:11,100
being carried by the waves.

273
00:18:11,290 --> 00:18:15,740
Look at them all,

274
00:18:13,450 --> 00:18:15,740
being drowned.

275
00:18:15,570 --> 00:18:19,060
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

276
00:18:18,850 --> 00:18:22,140
